# Sphinx of the Final Word: "This spell can't be countered" (CR 101.2, 701.5a). In turn 3 Bot1 casts it ({5}{U}{U}: two Islands,
# Black Lotus for three, Mox Ruby and Mox Jet) into Bot2's two open blue mana (Island, Mox Sapphire) and Counterspell. Counterspell may
# still be cast at it - the spell is a legal target - but does nothing: the Sphinx resolves, a 5/5 flier with hexproof, and the Counterspell is
# spent in Bot2's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Island
Sphinx of the Final Word
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Counterspell
Island x20

